{"title":"Hybrid ASCII Art","link":"https://kottke.org/25/09/hybrid-ascii-art","date":1758736323000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/enigmatriz-ascii-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/enigmatriz-ascii-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/enigmatriz-ascii-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1300\" alt=\"ASCII art overlaid on two people boxing\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/enigmatriz-ascii-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/enigmatriz-ascii-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/enigmatriz-ascii-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1300\" alt=\"ASCII art of a horse overlaid on a man riding a bucking bronco\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/enigmatriz-ascii-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/enigmatriz-ascii-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/enigmatriz-ascii-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1300\" alt=\"ASCII art overlaid on a pair of black shoes\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/enigmatriz-ascii-04.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/enigmatriz-ascii-04.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/enigmatriz-ascii-04.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1300\" alt=\"ASCII art incorporated into an illustration of horses\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/enigmatriz-ascii-05.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/enigmatriz-ascii-05.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/enigmatriz-ascii-05.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1464\" alt=\"ASCII art overlaid on Vermeer's painting of a milkmaid\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/enigmatriz-ascii-06.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/enigmatriz-ascii-06.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/enigmatriz-ascii-06.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"923\" alt=\"ASCII art overlaid on a painting of two religious men\" /></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://enigmatriz.com/\">Enigmatriz</a> uses ASCII art to punch up and blow out public domain photos and illustrations — I love their style. From <a href=\"https://www.itsnicethat.com/articles/enigmatriz-digital-art-discover-100925\">It’s Nice That</a>:</p>\n\n<blockquote><p>Using the Image to ASCII tool available online, Enigmatriz found a new way to play with digital assets. “Everyday, I sit on my computer and browse through hundreds of images in the public domain to find things that catch my attention and feel are worth shining a new light on them,” says Enigmatriz. “When working with ASCII, what I like and find particularly interesting is the blend between hundred old paintings, photographs etc. and modern technologies.” Enigmatriz creates unique contrasts between images — historical paintings are overlaid with spatterings of text, ASCII renders are layered on top of playing cards or archival imagery.</p></blockquote>\n\n<p>You can find more of their work <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/enigmatriz\">on Instagram</a>.</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/ASCII\">ASCII</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/design\">design</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Enigmatriz\">Enigmatriz</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/remix\">remix</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/09/hybrid-ascii-art\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"34d09173e37f7d68b23feadf0a79025217bb952bd580cc46a828ac805eb9108c","category":"Sites"}